<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/21st-century">21st century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">2004</h1><p class="ref-lede">2004 in world history: 19 events, 13 deaths and 1 work. 257 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
