<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-lithuania"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Lithuania.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Lithuania</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Lithuania joins NATO and the European Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-estonia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Estonia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Estonia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Estonia joins NATO and the European Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-latvia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Latvia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Latvia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Latvia joins NATO and the European Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-arab-emirates"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20Arab%20Emirates.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United Arab Emirates</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Zayed dies and is succeeded by Khalifa bin Zayed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-yemen"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Yemen.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Yemen</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first of six wars against the Houthi movement begins in Saada</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/indonesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Indonesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Indonesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">First direct presidential election; the Indian Ocean tsunami devastates Aceh</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hungary"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hungary.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hungary</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hungary joins the European Union on 1 May.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hellenic-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hellenic%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hellenic Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Athens hosts the Summer Olympic Games.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/singapore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Singapore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Singapore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Lee Hsien Loong, Lee Kuan Yew's eldest son, becomes the third prime minister.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/tamil"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tamil.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tamil</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Tamil becomes the first legally recognised classical language of India</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/guarani"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Guarani.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Guarani</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Guarani becomes the second official language of the Argentine province of Corrientes</span></li></ul></section>
